entry.summary:
Most analytics pipelines measure what happened. I wanted to measure why it matters, using LLM-powered semantic enrichment to understand content quality, not just view counts.
Key Design Decisions 1. **Medallion Architecture (Bronze → Silver → Gold)** Bronze: Raw YouTube API snapshots (append-only historical record) 2. **Semantic Enrichment as a Separate Layer** Enrich once, not on every daily run 3. Constrained LLM Outputs {
This reduced parsing errors from 35% to under 5%. What This Enables Do sensational videos grow faster but decay quicker? This is about measuring content quality vs. growth sustainability—not just counting clicks. The Stack Orchestration: EventBridge + Lambda Read More Schema evolution failures and fixes 📝 Full article: Medium 📝 The product thinking behind it: Mood Meets Media 💻 GitHub: *Live code
